<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Amalgamated half yr net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Amalgamated half yr net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>		  (A$ million unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit			34.30 vs 31.06</p>
<p>    Net profit				19.59 vs 20.53</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			  5.0 vs 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Amalgamated Holdings Ltd is a cinema, hotel and resort operator.</p>
